<title>SINGAPORE: Centrepoint 1996 net profit up 39.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Centrepoint 1996 net profit up 39.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months ending September 30 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		     125.87   vs   89.96</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)	  21.30   vs   21.50</p>
<p>    Final dividend		   9.00   vs    1.00</p>
<p>    Turnover			 326.33   vs  241.88</p>
<p>    Other income		     8.52   vs    6.20</p>
<p>    Interest expense		 5.94   vs    7.92</p>
<p>    Depreciation		     0.46   vs    0.79</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		 170.80   vs  120.93</p>
<p>    Tax				 44.94   vs   30.98</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries		  0.03   vs    nil</p>
<p>Dividend register /pay date  - March 5 1997/ to be announced Note - Full name of the company is Centrepoint Properties Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
